  "label": "The bulldog is mapped as the speaker of the declaration",
  "description": "The text 'i am never drinking with you fuckers ever again!' is explicitly attributed to the bulldog through visual juxtaposition. The bulldog's angry expression and posture are used to visually represent the speaker of the text, creating an analogical mapping where the bulldog stands in for the person making the declaration. This is a common meme trope where an animal's expression is used to convey human emotion and intent.",
